4. Other Income includes Rs. 88.974 Million representing an insurance claim in respect of losses arising from a fire incident at the Holding Company's Urwade premises in March 2025. Since the related losses had already been recognized and expensed in the previous year, the claim has been recognized as income during the current quarter upon receipt of final approval from the insurance company. Out of the total claim amount, Rs. 65.000 Million had been received as an advance in earlier years and the balance amount of Rs. 23.974 Million has been recognized under Other Receivables as at 30 June 2026. &lt;br /&gt; 
